              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 7.1-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Then Pharisees and scribes came to Jesus from Jerusalem and said, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Why do your disciples transgress the tradition of the elders? For they do not wash their hands when they eat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He answered them, “And why do you transgress the commandment of God for the sake of your tradition? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 20.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 5.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 21.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 20.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For God commanded, ‘Honor your father and your mother,’ and, ‘He who speaks evil of father or mother, let him surely die.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But you say, ‘If any one tells his father or his mother, What you would have gained from me is given to God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "an offering",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " he need not honor his father.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So, for the sake of your tradition, you have made void the word",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Other ancient authorities read",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "law",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You hypocrites! Well did Isaiah prophesy of you, when he said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he called the people to him and said to them, “Hear and understand: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.10.14+ACT.10.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 10.14-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1TI.4.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tim 4.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " not what goes into the mouth defiles a man, but what comes out of the mouth, this defiles a man.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the disciples came and said to him, “Do you know that the Pharisees were offended when they heard this saying?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.60.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 60.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.15.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 15.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " He answered, “Every plant which my heavenly Father has not planted will be rooted up. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.6.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 6.39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 23.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.2.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 2.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Let them alone; they are blind guides. And if a blind man leads a blind man, both will fall into a pit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Peter said to him, “Explain the parable to us.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, “Are you also still without understanding? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do you not see that whatever goes into the mouth passes into the stomach, and so passes on?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15.17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "is evacuated",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But what comes out of the mouth proceeds from the heart, and this defiles a man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.5.19+GAL.5.20+GAL.5.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 5.19-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.6.9+1CO.6.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cor 6.9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.14.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 14.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For out of the heart come evil thoughts, murder, adultery, fornication, theft, false witness, slander. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are what defile a man; but to eat with unwashed hands does not defile a man.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
