                  "text": "Mt 9.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Then Jesus called his disciples to him and said, “I have compassion on the crowd, because they have been with me now three days, and have nothing to eat; and I am unwilling to send them away hungry, lest they faint on the way.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the disciples said to him, “Where are we to get bread enough in the desert to feed so great a crowd?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus said to them, “How many loaves have you?” They said, “Seven, and a few small fish.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And commanding the crowd to sit down on the ground, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he took the seven loaves and the fish, and having given thanks he broke them and gave them to the disciples, and the disciples gave them to the crowds. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they all ate and were satisfied; and they took up seven baskets full of the broken pieces left over. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who ate were four thousand men, besides women and children. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And sending away the crowds, he got into the boat and went to the region of Magadan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.15.39"
            ]
          }
        }
